  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.14.7 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* Upgrade embedded pip/setuptools/wheel and CI test tools by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3385\n* 🧪 test(seed): verify periodic update scheduling by @darrenhuai in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3384\n* feat(python): default to Python 3.15 by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3386\n* 🔧 chore: enroll in Anthropic OSS Scanner by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3387\n* 🧪 test(util): skip safe_delete permission tests as root by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3389\n* 📝 docs(security): add an email reporting contact by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3388\n* 🐛 fix(activation): escape the bash prompt for both PS1 passes by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3390\n* 🧪 test(activation): undo both bash prompt passes on bash < 4.4 by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3392\n* 🔧 build(release): bump pydantic for 3.15 wheels by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3391\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.14.6...21.14.7",
